{"schema_version":"1.8.0","id":"ALSA-2026:47179","published":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-08-06T16:15:06.620731503Z","related":["CVE-2026-59691","CVE-2026-59692"],"summary":"Important: gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free security update","details":"GStreamer is a streaming media framework based on graphs of filters which operate on media data. The gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free package contains a collection of plug-ins for GStreamer.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * gstreamer: gstreamer: rfbsrc/librfb Hextile heap out-of-bounds write with 16bpp framebuffer (CVE-2026-59691)\n  * gstreamer: gstreamer: DTLS certificate Subject DN stack buffer overflow in openssl_verify_callback (CVE-2026-59692)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.22.12-7.el9_8.3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:47179.json"}},{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.22.12-7.el9_8.3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:47179.json"}},{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-libs","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-libs"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.22.12-7.el9_8.3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:47179.json"}}],"refer